@startuml user_types
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 8

rectangle "Probon Users" as Users

rectangle "Teachers\n(Course Instructors)" as Teachers
rectangle "Students\n(Team Members)" as Students
rectangle "Infrastructure Administrator\n(Server / DevOps Level Only)" as Admin

rectangle "Student Team Leader\n(Designated Student Role)" as Leader

Users -down-> Teachers
Users -down-> Students
Users -down-> Admin

Students -down-> Leader

note right of Teachers
  • Create & manage classes
  • Set milestone checkpoints
  • Authoritative task verification
  • Qualitative 1-5 star feedback
end note

note right of Students
  • Join class via unique code
  • Form collaborative project teams
  • Work on Kanban tasks & submit evidence
  • Earn XP & track contribution share
end note

note right of Leader
  • Links GitHub repository URL
  • Coordinates team milestone dates
end note

note right of Admin
  • Server provisioning & deployment
  • SQLite WAL database backups
  • Environment configuration
  (No in-app student/teacher role)
end note

@enduml
